          "rulename": "'Blimey, they got away!'",
          "ruleFull": "If the warband routs, any Swabbie who has already left the table in an earlier turn escapes for good: remove him from the roster as if he had been killed."
        },
        {
          "rulename": "'Don't mind them mates, they ain't true pirates!'",
          "ruleFull": "Swabbies who are running away or have been taken out of action do not count towards the warband's rout test."
